From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:50:35 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Skip the matched NDVE movie reconstruction sequence after
 native scaling

(cherry picked from commit 76c20edba480db753ce7092cd2677f6c4a8daa15)

Adapted to the pin: the scaled output is marked GPU-written with
mtl_tex_gpu_written(desc), since upstream e2b76d4e replaced
mtl_pool_gpu_written(pool) with it.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#1331
Reason: Ocarina of Time's title movie and title screen run at 30 fps with the audio drifting behind the picture without it; upstream has not merged the PR yet
Issue: seedds/nxnative#1375
